  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc54:2.3.2": "“Testing” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>paripuccha</i>. The basic meaning of <i lang='pi' translate='no'>paripucchā</i> is “to question” or “to ask”, as used for instance in <a href='https://suttacentral.net/pli-tv-bu-vb-pc71/en/brahmali#1.19.1'>Bu Pc 71</a>. Often, however, as in the present case, it refers to a teacher questioning his student, in the sense of finding out how much the student knows. In such cases I render the word as “testing”. ",
